# [UNOFFICIAL] H96 Max V58 · Armbian on RK3588 · open GPU stack · v8.0

> **Device:** H96 Max V58 (Rockchip RK3588, 8 GB RAM, 64 GB eMMC)
> **Status:** Unofficial, community built, not affiliated with Armbian project
> **Releases:** v8.0, Ubuntu image and Debian Edition image, on [Releases page](https://github.com/Scrumpper/H96_MAX_V58_Unofficial-Armbian/releases).

---

## What is this

Armbian image for H96 Max V58 Android TV box, plus board sources image is built from.
Box stops being locked Android player and becomes arm64 Linux machine.

Image boots to text console with SSH. Desktop installs afterwards on demand, or box runs
as headless server.

GPU runs open **Panthor** kernel driver with **Mesa**, not closed vendor Mali blob: desktop
composites on Mali-G610, Vulkan runs on PanVK, and video decodes on Rockchip VPU.

