## Armbian 8.0

8.0 is platform release over v7.2.

| Area | 8.0 |
|---|---|
| Kernels | 6.12.69 default: Panthor GPU interface 1.5, RAM scaling, eMMC software queue, hardening options. 6.1.172 fallback: same feature set as v7.2 kernel. Packages `h96-kernel-<krel>` and `h96-dtb-<krel>`; modules in `/usr/lib/modules/<krel>/`. |
| Kernel switch | `h96-kernel-switch try <krel>` boots kernel as trial; `confirm` keeps it, reboot without confirm returns to previous kernel. See [docs/KERNEL-SWITCH.md](docs/KERNEL-SWITCH.md). |
| Userland | Packages `h96-base`, `h96-boot`, `h96-net`, `h96-audio`, `h96-desktop`, `h96-media`, `h96-tools`, `h96-gaming`. Commands in `/usr/bin` and `/usr/sbin`, helpers in `/usr/lib/h96`, settings in `/etc/h96`. Nothing packaged under `/usr/local` or `/opt`. |
| GPU | Mesa only (Panfrost GL, PanVK Vulkan). `libmali` removed. |
| Power | New Power Save profile; DDR scales 528 to 2112 MHz on kernel 6.12. |
| Display | FreeSync with `sudo h96-vrr on` (off by default); HDMI-CEC TV remote on by default; experimental Plasma (Wayland) session beside default Plasma (X11). |
| Steam | Steam ARM 3.1 from package `steam-arm-setup`, `h96-steam` front end. |
| Editions | Ubuntu image and Debian Edition ([docs/DEBIAN-EDITION.md](docs/DEBIAN-EDITION.md)). |

