## Desktops

**None installed by default.** Pick one after flashing:

```
armbian-config  ->  System  ->  Desktop
```

KDE Plasma runs on X11 with LightDM by default. Plasma (Wayland) session is experimental:
`sudo h96-autologin-setup --session plasma`. KDE keeps installing packages in background after first login; wait
ten minutes or more before judging anything missing, and do not reboot or unplug box
while it installs.

